{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54368","headline":"延福院（句） · 朱着","name":"延福院（句）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞口花开新佛寺，岭头苔锁古仙坛。\n（见明人姜准《歧海琐谭》卷五引南宋曹叔远《永嘉谱》）（按：朱着逸诗及小传，皆承张靖龙同志录示。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱着","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54368.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54368","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}